    {"title": "Tense TPM05 Energy Analyser: Basic Data Modbus Address", "note": "register list, 3 pages; the document prints no revision or date"}
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Tense TPM05. Addresses are decimal register addresses (4000 = 0x0FA0 to 4087 = 0x0FF7), read with FC03.",
    "Values are 16-bit unless typed uint32 (2 registers). The document does not state the word order of the 32-bit energy counters; big-endian is assumed.",
    "scale holds only the fixed multiplier. Voltage = raw x VT x 0.1 and current = raw x CT x 0.001, where CT and VT are the transformer ratios in registers 4000 and 4001 (VT already x0.1 there). Power = raw x CT x VT."
  ],
  "byte_order": "big",
  "word_order": "big",
